pan></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台灣證券交易所初步統計，受疫情影響，上市公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月營收總計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8,800</span>億元，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.12</span>％，不過，主力產業的半導體單月營收年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">34.59</span>％，而防疫股的生技股營收也有年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8.01</span>％表現。證交所表示，上市公司大陸營運據點大部分均已復工，產能逐漸恢復，將可提振業績。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台灣上市公司共有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">866</span>家、第一上市公司有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">76</span>家，證交所昨日傍晚統計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">832</span>家國內上市公司及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">67</span>家第一上市公司，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月營收總計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8,800</span>億元，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">808</span>億元，年減幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.12</span>％，營收成長公司共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">451</span>家，衰退公司共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">448</span>家；這<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">899</span>家公司前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月累計營收總計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3,135</span>億元，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3,949</span>億元，年減幅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8.39</span>％，營收成長公司共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">294</span>家，衰退公司共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">605</span>家。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證交所指出，上市公司營收雖受疫情衝擊，惟個別產業表現各有不同，其中個別公司營收變化仍視其接單與生產基地分布狀況而定。而我國主力產業半導體單月及累計前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月營收分別年成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">34.59</span>％及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">24.32</span>％，主要個別公司客戶需求增加。另外，防疫類股相關的生技醫療業<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月營收較年成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8.01</span>％，內需相關食品工業<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月營收亦年成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5.78</span>％。</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-